# VHS recording: diary append workflow
# Shows appending text to diary (agent-friendly workflow)

Output docs/screenshots/append-workflow.gif

Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 600
Set TypingSpeed 50ms

Type `diary ttal append "Reflection on today's work. Noticed I'm more confident with the core concepts."`
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 2s
